{"id":"d0789749a0d83f0d","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-fin-deriv-tree.md","title":"Finite Derivation Tree","display":"df-fin-deriv-tree — Finite Derivation Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-fin-deriv-tree","aliases":["57-df-fin-deriv-tree"],"display":"df-fin-deriv-tree — Finite Derivation Tree","depends_on":["[[57-df-sequent]]","[[57-df-sequent-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-fin-deriv-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-fin-deriv-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fin-deriv-tree — Finite Derivation Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35a80f442c4e1ba6\" href=\"?note=35a80f442c4e1ba6\" title=\"57-df-sequent\">57-df-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e03b0a4a070eb4c\" href=\"?note=7e03b0a4a070eb4c\" title=\"57-df-sequent-rule\">57-df-sequent-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{SeqRule}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{SeqRule}_S\\)</span>；类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35a80f442c4e1ba6\" href=\"?note=35a80f442c4e1ba6\" title=\"57-df-sequent\">57-df-sequent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e03b0a4a070eb4c\" href=\"?note=7e03b0a4a070eb4c\" title=\"57-df-sequent-rule\">57-df-sequent-rule</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\langle q,\\vec d\\rangle\">\\(d=\\langle q,\\vec d\\rangle\\)</span> 是根标记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>、子树列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\">\\(\\vec d\\)</span> 的有限树；这种带标签构造子单射且与矢列构造子区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_n\">\\(\\mathcal D_n\\)</span> 按深度定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 保留原书的“可作有限树根的矢列集合”含义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 才是树集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{root}\">\\(\\mathrm{root}\\)</span> 为根函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinDerTree}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinDerTree}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{root}(\\langle q,\\vec d\\rangle)\\coloneqq q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{root}(\\langle q,\\vec d\\rangle)\\coloneqq q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,\\langle\\rangle\\rangle:q\\in\\mathrm{Ax}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_n\\cup\n\\{\\langle q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle\\rangle:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\land(d_1,\\ldots,d_k)\\in\\mathcal D_n^k\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{root}(d_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{root}(d_k)\\rangle,q\\rangle\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal D_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{root}(d):d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinDerTree}_{q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}:\\mathrm{root}(d)=q\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,\\langle\\rangle\\rangle:q\\in\\mathrm{Ax}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_n\\cup\n\\{\\langle q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle\\rangle:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\land(d_1,\\ldots,d_k)\\in\\mathcal D_n^k\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{root}(d_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{root}(d_k)\\rangle,q\\rangle\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal D_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{root}(d):d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinDerTree}_{q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}:\\mathrm{root}(d)=q\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不将公式、矢列、树三种类型混在同一个最小闭包中；对零前提规则也有明确处理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"35a80f442c4e1ba6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"7e03b0a4a070eb4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"35a80f442c4e1ba6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S$、$\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{SeqRule}_S$；类型见 [[57-df-sequent]]、[[57-df-sequent-rule]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"7e03b0a4a070eb4c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S$、$\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{SeqRule}_S$；类型见 [[57-df-sequent]]、[[57-df-sequent-rule]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\mathrm{SeqRule}_S","display":false},{"tex":"d=\\langle q,\\vec d\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{root}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinDerTree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{root}(\\langle q,\\vec d\\rangle)\\coloneqq q.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_0&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,\\langle\\rangle\\rangle:q\\in\\mathrm{Ax}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{n+1}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_n\\cup\n\\{\\langle q,\\langle d_1,\\ldots,d_k\\rangle\\rangle:k\\in\\mathbb N\\land q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\land(d_1,\\ldots,d_k)\\in\\mathcal D_n^k\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{root}(d_1),\\ldots,\\mathrm{root}(d_k)\\rangle,q\\rangle\\in R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal D_n,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{root}(d):d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FinDerTree}_{q}&\\coloneqq\\{d\\in\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{\\mathcal P}:\\mathrm{root}(d)=q\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1961,"backlinks":[{"id":"5d26264b420dc144","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathrm{SC}}$ (SC的有限推导树, see [[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]])"},{"id":"177be28d1dd7c11d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，见 [[57-df-sequent]]；$\\mathcal P=\\mathrm{SC}$ 见 [[57-df-SequentCalculus]]，其初始矢列见 [[57-df-axiom-sequent]]。树与根取 [[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]] 在该 $\\mathcal P$ 下的实例。"},{"id":"b5aa90b37d1feafa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\mathrm{SC}=\\langle\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules}_{SC}\\rangle$ 取 [[57-df-SequentCalculus]]；该系统本身不含 CUT。$\\mathrm{CUT}$ 取 [[57-df-cut-sequent]] 的切割关系，$\\mathrm{FinDerivTree}_{\\mathcal P}$ 取 [[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]。对本文件的扩展系统，$\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\Delta$ 表示根矢列 $\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\Delta$ 属于该系统的根集合。"},{"id":"9ac2726b1083a9db","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为有限的无量词且无等号公式集；$\\mathrm{EqFree}$ 取 [[57-df-herbrand-expansion]]。$\\mathrm{DerTrees}_{SC}$、$\\mathrm{root}$ 取 [[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]，$\\mathrm{Sf}$ 取 [[57-df-subformula]]。对 $q=\\Gamma_q\\Rightarrow\\Delta_q$，$\\mathrm{forms}(q)=\\Gamma_q\\cup\\Delta_q$；$\\mathrm{NodeForms}$ 按有限树递归。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[5